OL,3,GNEWSADate set for Forest stadium
OL,4,Aexpansion plan meeting
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to expand Nottingham Forest's
OL,7,Fhome ground will be discussed at a
OL,8,Fcouncil meeting later this month.
OL,10,FRushcliffe Borough Council's planning
OL,11,Fcommittee will meet from 18:00 BST on
OL,12,F16 September to consider applications
OL,13,Ffrom the club on proposed amendments to
OL,14,Fthe City Ground.
OL,16,FIt comes days after MPs in Nottingham
OL,17,Fissued a joint statement backing
OL,18,Fdevelopment of the stadium.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
